ath the moonlight.","abilities":["Prioritizes attacking the target with the current lowest HP percentage within a small area"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":600,"def":240,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"nethersea_swarmcaller":{"slug":"nethersea_swarmcaller","name":"Nethersea Swarmcaller","icon":"/enemies-icons/Nethersea Swarmcaller.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sea Monster","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A rare Sea Terror, able to manipulate the tiny creatures in the air and on the ground to eat away at their surroundings even in the absence of the nethersea brand. They seem to call the brand itself to life, hence their name.","abilities":["Continually inflicts Arts damage and Nervous Impairment in an area around it","Has Status resistance and is immune to Slow"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":200,"def":700,"res":65,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"pocket_sea_crawler":{"slug":"pocket_sea_crawler","name":"Pocket Sea Crawler","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pocket Sea Crawler.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sea Monster","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Sea Terror imbued with impurities. The density of its body tissue surpasses that of some alloys. Victims stabbed by it will feel as if they have been set alight.","abilities":["Whenever a certain percentage of HP is lost, immediately deal a large amount of Arts damage and Nervous Impairment to nearby units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":300,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"thirster":{"slug":"thirster","name":"Thirster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Thirster.webp","rank":